<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian P-Notes - Tenders total A$90 mln.</title>
<headline>Australian P-Notes - Tenders total A$90 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian commercial paper market saw four promissory note tenders on Wednesday totalling A$90 million.</p>
<p>The largest offering was for Boral which came for A$40 million of August 22 dated paper, which fetched a yield of 5.34 percent.</p>
